title: "GlassBox: Zero-Overhead Flight Recorder & Mechanistic Interpretability Engine for PyTorch LLMs"
abstract: "A zero-overhead flight recorder and mechanistic interpretability engine for PyTorch LLMs, providing non-blocking asynchronous DMA activation streaming, real-time activation steering and causal ablation, multi-layer Logit Lens, and cryptographically sealed provenance."
